# QA Assessment Rules

- Use Playwright with PrismStructure (Page Object Model) for all automation.
- Keep manual, UI, and API test cases between 5-8 each, tagged @Smoke or @regression.
- Generate unique test data per run to avoid account lockouts.
- Press Confirm twice on checkout to generate invoice.
- Document all AI prompts in ai-prompts/ folder.
- Commit iteratively — do not push everything in a single commit.
- All test execution reports must show Passed status.
